description	"Astromech Droid

A plucky support with numerous gadgets.

^2Weaponry:
- Body Slam (Limited Melee)
-- Heavyweight
-- Secondary fire only
- Jet Burst (Flamethrower)
-- Ignites on hit
-- 1000% more damage
-- 11900% slower reload
- Arc Welder (1)
-- Shocks on hit

^5Powers:
- Steam Projector (Push 1)
-- Shrouds on use
- Electroshock Probe (Lightning 1) ^3[CS4]
-- 100% more damage
- Overclock (Speed 3) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Strength (2)
- Impact Diffusion
- Climate Shielding (1)
- Cortosis (1)
- Armor Regen (1)
- Healing (2)
- Resource Regen: 2/1s
- Passive Radar Scanner (Miraluka 1)
- Ally Stat Viewer
- Blasterbound
- 25% faster hacking

^3Abilities:
- BP/Resource Dispenser (2) ^3[Use]
-- +1 range
- Jet Boosters (Jetpack)
- Pocket (Wrist) Laser ^3[CS1]
- Panic (Barge 3) ^3[Melee CS2]"